                                                <string key="text">This document, the Work Order, Attachments A and B, and Refloor Guarantees state the entire Contract between you (“owner” or “buyer”) and Refloor (“we” or “our”). NO REPRESENTATIONS, PROMISES, OR WARRANTIES, EXPRESSED OR IMPLIED, HAVE BEEN MADE BY REFLOOR TO THE OWNER EXCEPT THOSE WHICH ARE STATED IN THIS CONTRACT. This Contract, Attachments, Refloor Guarantees, and Work Order cannot be changed by any conversations between Owner and Refloor. Any changes must be approved by Owner and Refloor.</string>
