                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">, installation dates may change. No discounts will be given due to scheduling conflicts or the length of the job. If Refloor must reschedule an installation for other reasons such as, but not limited to, transportation issues, illness, project delays, and general emergencies, Refloor will credit Owner’s account $100 per occurrence for any inconvenience</string>
