                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Removal of existing hard surface (wood, tile, other) may cause a height change that can create a gap in, or paint line to be exposed on, door frames, existing trim, and/or base molding. We are not responsible for any repair or finish carpentry work needed due to the removal of the existing floor. The Installer is not qualified to do carpentry work.</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
