                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content" base64-UTF8="YES">
Cg
</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Our flooring is designed to be installed on and contour to existing surfaces without excessive floor preparation. If your floor was not level before your new flooring is installed, your floor would not be level after your new floors are installed. If our Installer determines that floor leveling or patching compound is required, Refloor will apply for free, one layer up to ten (10) sq. ft. per room. If additional leveling is required to complete a proper flooring installation, the cost incurred will be $2.00 per sq. ft. We also may use shims and asphalt shingles. We will attempt to make the floors as level as possible but cannot guarantee a perfectly level floor.</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
