                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">If your subfloors squeaked before your new flooring being installed, they would squeak after your new floors are installed. Our flooring does not cause subfloors to squeak. If Owner requests, the Installer can add screws to the existing subfloor to reduce squeaks. We cannot guarantee squeak-free floors.</string>
