                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Refloor will remove, cut down, and rehang one (1) single-hinged door per room at no additional cost. For additional single-hinged doors, the</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment content=" ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">cost incurred will be $40.00 per door. Refloor will remove, cut down, and rehang sliding, or bi-fold doors, and the cost incurred will be $20.00</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment content=" ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">per door panel. We do not cut down pocket doors or metal doors. You will need to hire your own contractor to complete this work. Our Installer</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.1764705882352941" green="0.20392156862745098" blue="0.23921568627450979" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
