                                        <color key="backgroundColor" white="1" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="genericGamma22GrayColorSpace"/>
                                        <string key="text">I certify that the above statements are true and completely accurate and that no unfavorable information known to me for use herein has been omitted. I authorize you and your assigns to obtain and review our credit bureau, verify the information contained herein and retain this application as your property whether or not a finance relationship is consummated, and make any investigation you deem advisable before or after a finance relationship is made. If credit is denied, I am entitled to a clear and meaningful statement in writing of the reasons. I further authorize the communication and release of this application and its related information to any lenders, brokers or other finance institutions who you believe may have an interest in providing financing to me for the transaction in question, and I agree that I may be contacted via telephone so I may be presented with financing options to consider. This is to protect ourselves against the EPA for lead paint claims.</string>
