                                                        <string key="content">What lies beneath or beside an existing floor surface cannot be inspected until the existing surface is removed during installation. Circumstances may include holes or opening in walls, floors, or staircase, the reveal of unfinished areas such as undersides of stair tread, or any other incomplete segments of the property.</string>
