                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" lineSpacing="1" defaultTabInterval="28" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Although we take every reasonable precaution in Owner’s homes, items can break and surfaces, including drywall, can be damaged in the process of renovation. Refloor shall not be liable for: (1) any resultant damages to premises or material located on the premises; (2)any fumes caused by building materials; (3) any plumbing or mechanical misalignment or failures. Refloor is not responsible for any work performed by a contractor or subcontractor that falls outside the scope of this contract</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="18" name="Avenir-Medium"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" lineSpacing="1" defaultTabInterval="28" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
