                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Owner agree to provide reasonable access to the property, from 8:00 am to 6:00 pm Monday through Friday, for Punch List completion. Any days owner doesn't provide reasonable access, is un-countable, or initiates special requests, such as an inspection, will ne subtracted from the day count.</string>
